{"id":"steam-1171610","steam":1171610,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Neon District: Season One","summary":"F2P Cyberpunk RPG like never before. Battle through procedural and story-driven missions to collect characters, gear, juice and parts. Adapt quickly to increasingly difficult enemies and complex puzzles, master the rich trading-card game battle mechanics, and grok tactics to survive in the District.","about":"Neon District is the cyberpunk role-playing adventure and flagship franchise developed by Blockade Games. Leveraging the latest in decentralized technologies, players battle to progress through a sci-fi dystopia and earn in-game items.\r\n\r\nNeon District: Season One features a full single-player campaign filled with crime syndicates, oracles, cogs, genetic mods, winding plots, and a morally-questionable cast of characters. Play through scores of missions and complete contracts to survive, and you'll find yourself falling deeper into the dark, seedy reality underlying the powers-that-be within Unity.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171610/library_600x900.jpg?t=1624819768","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171610/header.jpg?t=1624819768","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171610/library_hero.jpg?t=1624819768","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171610/header.jpg?t=1624819768","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171610/ss_59d513093899d32a044b1dc44fc14979e05e1085.600x338.jpg?t=1624819768","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171610/ss_59d513093899d32a044b1dc44fc14979e05e1085.jpg?t=1624819768"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171610/ss_9670a68a651a55814f415b637bafce0650c74acb.600x338.jpg?t=1624819768","full":"https://sh